end`,'经典交换：两行都用非阻塞 <=。非阻塞的语义是"同一拍里所有右边先一起算，再一起写左边"，所以 q1、q2 真的对调了——这正是时序块该有的并行行为。','The classic swap: both lines use non-blocking <=. Non-blocking means "within one cycle, all right-hand sides are evaluated together, then all left-hand sides are written together", so q1 and q2 genuinely swap — the parallel behavior a clocked block should have.'),d(`// 若改成阻塞 =：
//   q1 = q2;  // q1 立刻变成 q2
